<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ob-lātro</span></b> , 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n., to bark
			at;</i> only in the trop. signif., <i>to rail</i> or
				<i>carp at</i> (postAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>dat.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 3, 43, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oblatrare veritati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 5, 4, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					8, 251</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nescio quid,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 13</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ambros. Spir. S. 3, 13, 92</span></i>;
			Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 10,
			913.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(g).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>, <i><span class="en">Amm. 14, 9, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17, 11,
			4</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
